---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WritingLink from '../../components/WritingLink.astro';
import { supportedLangs } from '../../i18n/config';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return supportedLangs.map((lang) => ({ params: { lang } }));
}
const lang = Astro.params.lang!;
---

<BaseLayout title="My work" lang={lang} active="experience" description="Selected production work by Jaime Quintero Sicre: recovering contracts after a Java batch failure, investigating slow queries and addressing recurring incidents.">
  <div class="experience-page">
    <header class="experience-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">My work</p>
        <h1>Fixing problems in production</h1>
        <p class="role-meta">Enterprise Solutions Engineer · NTT DATA<br />October 2024 – Present · Working fully remotely</p>
        <p class="intro-copy">I work on enterprise platforms using Java and PostgreSQL. Here are a few cases from production, with the changes I worked on and how they turned out.</p>
      </div>
      <WritingLink lang={lang} />
    </header>

    <section id="batch-recovery" class="batch-case" aria-labelledby="batch-title">
      <div class="batch-story">
        <p class="eyebrow">Java · Batch processing</p>
        <h2 id="batch-title">Recovering contracts after a batch failure</h2>
        <p>A defect left more than 3,000 contracts incorrectly suspended. Their payment receipts were not being submitted for collection, putting €60,000 at risk.</p>
        <p>I fixed the original Java batch process and added filtered execution to select and recover the affected contracts. We reused that recovery functionality in later incidents.</p>
        <p>I also corrected the affected data and followed up on contracts and payments, working with managers and the joint venture.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="batch-result" aria-label="Recovery result">
        <strong>87%</strong>
        <p>of the €60,000 at risk recovered through the team’s work.</p>
        <p class="result-detail">Every eligible contract was reinstated.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <article class="search-preview">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Current work · PostgreSQL</p>
        <h2><a href={`/${lang}/work/search-panel`}>Looking beyond a slow search panel</a></h2>
        <p>Search and export were both struggling under load. After improving the queries, we began questioning whether large exports should run through the panel at all.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`/${lang}/work/search-panel`}>Read case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="search-measure"><strong>Over 60s → about 4s</strong><span>Same search query and data in initial tests. Changes are still in testing.</span></p>
    </article>

    <div class="supporting-cases">
      <section aria-labelledby="recurring-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Recurring incidents</p>
        <h2 id="recurring-title">Finding what kept breaking</h2>
        <p>In March 2026, I helped identify five recurring root causes with the L2 lead. I contributed to changes in the affected flows, supervised their introduction into production and helped address problems missed in testing.</p>
        <p class="case-outcome">Across the team’s work, the backlog fell from <strong>284 to 175</strong> between March and August 2026.</p>
      </section>
      <section aria-labelledby="launch-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Three product launches</p>
        <h2 id="launch-title">Following what happened after release</h2>
        <p>I monitored contract volumes and API performance using PostgreSQL, Grafana and logs during launches in September 2025, December 2025 and March 2026.</p>
        <p>By the March launch, I was leading the daily data presentations to managers and Operations, explaining what we were seeing in production.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="team-context" aria-labelledby="team-title">
      <h2 id="team-title">My role in the team</h2>
      <p>Since April 2026, I’ve led two developers in our production maintenance team. I assess incoming issues and assign fixes, staying involved when colleagues need technical support. I also manage stakeholder expectations and follow up on response and resolution deadlines.</p>
      <p class="earlier-role">Before my current role, I was a Software Engineer Intern at NTT DATA from October 2023 to June 2024, working on backend maintenance and debugging.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="academic-work" aria-labelledby="python-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">An earlier project</p>
        <h2 id="python-title">A Python animal-guessing game</h2>
      </div>
      <p>For my bachelor’s thesis, I built a local game and its interface in Python. It asked questions to narrow down the animal using Bayesian inference, entropy and information gain.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="experience-end">
      <a class="text-link" href={`/${lang}/articles`}>Read my articles <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href={`/${lang}/contact`}>Get in touch about a role <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .experience-page { padding: 24px 0 48px; }
  .experience-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; gap: 64px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-strong); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.035em; max-width: 17ch; }
  .role-meta { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 24px 0 18px; }
  .intro-copy { max-width: 54ch; margin: 0; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem); line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  h2 a { color: var(--text); }
  .batch-case { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 40px; padding: 36px; background: var(--bg-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); scroll-margin-top: 104px; }
  .batch-story p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 65ch; }
  .batch-story p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .batch-result { border-left: 1px solid var(--border); padding-left: 32px; align-self: center; }
  .batch-result strong { font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent-strong); letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .batch-result p { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .batch-result .result-detail { font-size: .85rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .search-preview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 40px; padding: 36px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .search-preview p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 64ch; }
  .search-measure { align-self: center; margin: 0; }
  .search-measure strong { display: block; color: var(--accent-strong); font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .search-measure span { display: block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: .85rem; }
  .supporting-cases { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; margin: 40px 0; }
  .supporting-cases section p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .case-outcome strong { color: var(--text); }
  .team-context { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 32px; }
  .team-context p { max-width: 77ch; }
  .earlier-role { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .academic-work { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr; gap: 40px; margin: 32px 0; padding: 28px 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .academic-work h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .academic-work .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .academic-work > p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0; }
  .experience-end { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 32px; }
  .text-link { min-height: 44px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .experience-intro { gap: 32px; }
    .batch-case, .search-preview { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    .batch-result { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 24px 0 0; }
    .batch-result .result-detail { border: 0; padding-top: 0; }
    .search-measure { border-left: 2px solid var(--border); padding-left: 20px; }
    .supporting-cases { gap: 32px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .experience-page { padding-top: 12px; }
    .experience-intro, .supporting-cases, .academic-work { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .experience-intro { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .batch-case { padding: 24px; }
    .supporting-cases { gap: 24px; margin: 32px 0; }
    .academic-work { gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
